<MessageStudioText
	Format="1.2" xmlns="nintendo:msgstudio">
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_c14r0401_nurse_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>マッギョの　たいらな　ところって
かなり　チャーミング　だよねー！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-17T03:29:26" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:12" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>マッギョの　平らな　ところって
かなり　チャーミング　だよねー！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-17T03:54:12" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:12" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♀
・クリア前のセリフ
・クリア後はnurse_02
※クリア後も来るようなセリフに要修正</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-17T03:58:32" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>NURSE</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-16T10:19:31" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:12" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#ffff80</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_c14r0401_nurse_02"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>マッギョの　たいらな　ところって
かなり　チャーミング　だよねー！▼
ほかにも　うすーい　ボディの
みずポケモン　しらないかな？</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-17T03:33:57" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-16T10:24:47" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>マッギョの　平らな　ところって
かなり　チャーミング　だよねー！▼
他にも　薄ーい　ボディの
みずポケモン　知らないかな？</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-17T03:54:27" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-16T10:26:05" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♀
・クリア後
・手持ちに
　ラブカスがいる→
　ラブカスがいない→</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-17T03:30:13" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>NURSE</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-17T03:58:43" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#ffff80</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_c14r0401_nurse_03"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>あーっ！
その　ハートがたの　ポケモン！▼
へー！　ラブカスって　いうんだ！
すごーい！　うすー！！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-17T03:47:50" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-17T03:47:23" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>あーっ！
その　ハート型の　ポケモン！▼
へー！　ラブカスって　いうんだ！
すごーい！　薄ー！！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-17T03:54:36" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-17T03:47:59" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♀
・手持ちにラブカスがいる
・アイテム入手処理
　No000「ハートのウロコ」×５
・入手不可能事は</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-17T03:34:37" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>NURSE</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-17T03:58:43" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#ffff80</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_c14r0401_nurse_04"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>あれ？　バッグいっぱいに
ハートのウロコを　もっているんだね！▼
ラブカスを　つれて
また　こんど　あそびに　きてね！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-17T03:55:10" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-17T03:37:33" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>あれ？　バッグ一杯に
ハートのウロコを　持っているんだね！▼
ラブカスを　連れて
また　今度　遊びに　来てね！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-17T03:55:02" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-17T03:47:59" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♀
・手持ちにラブカスがいるが
　アイテム入手不可能事</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-17T03:34:55" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>NURSE</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-17T03:58:43" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#ffff80</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_c14r0401_nurse_05"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>マッギョも　ラブカスも
うすーい　からだは　おんなじ！▼
だけど　たてに　うすいか
よこに　うすいかで　ぜんぜん▽
ちがった　いんしょうに　なるよね！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-17T03:43:48" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-17T03:42:33" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>マッギョも　ラブカスも
薄ーい　からだは　おんなじ！▼
だけど　縦に　うすいか
横に　薄いかで　全然▽
違った　印象に　なるよね！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-17T03:55:40" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-17T03:47:59" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♀
・アイテム入手後</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-17T03:35:04" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>NURSE</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-17T03:58:43" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#ffff80</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_c14r0401_nurse_06"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>たしか　「ラ」で　はじまる　なまえで
ハートの　かたちを　しているの！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-17T03:35:40" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-17T03:35:19" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>たしか　「ラ」で　はじまる　名前で
ハートの　形を　しているの！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-17T03:55:50" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-17T03:47:59" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♀
・クリア後
・手持ちにラブカスがいない</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-17T03:35:15" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>NURSE</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-17T03:58:43" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#ffff80</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_c14r0401_doctor_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>マッギョの　うえで　ねるとね
でんきで　からだが　ほぐれるんだ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-17T04:00:45" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-01T06:28:07" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>マッギョの　上で　寝るとね
微弱電流で　体が　ほぐれるんだ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-17T04:01:07" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-01T06:28:07" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-16T10:15:45" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>DOCTOR</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-16T10:19:41" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData />
